        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "\n> I was responsive, and there was an ongoing discussion in which you chose not to participate.\n\nI did replied, and that \"discussion\" totally irrelevant for the fix.\n\nYou've been non-responsive for over a week, leaving config broken for most users.\nIt's ok for adding new non-breaking feature, but your setup is rather niche, I'm not responsible for that.\n\nPlease do prioritize the fix next time for the break you applied to most users.",
